3. END-TO-END REQUEST LIFECYCLE
============================================================

Implement the actual orchestration lifecycle.

Conceptually:

1. Receive request
2. Validate request
3. Create/request correlation ID
4. Detect intent
5. Build context
6. Route to agent(s)
7. Build execution plan
8. Validate execution plan
9. Execute plan
10. Aggregate results
11. Build final response
12. Return response

Every stage must preserve required information.

No silent data loss.

No accidental mutation of request state.

